---
const wa = "https://wa.me/5215578688247";
const ig = "https://www.instagram.com/_amenocafe/";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Ameno Café — Próximamente</title>
<meta name="description" content="Café de especialidad para eventos en Minatitlán y Coatzacoalcos, Veracruz. Estamos preparando algo con calma.">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico">
<style>
@font-face{font-family:"Benton Modern Display";src:url("/fonts/BentonModDisp-Bold.otf") format("opentype");font-weight:700;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:"Avenir Next";src:url("/fonts/AvenirNext-Regular.otf") format("opentype");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:"Avenir Next";src:url("/fonts/AvenirNext-Demi.otf") format("opentype");font-weight:600;font-display:swap}
:root{--hueso:#f8f4ea;--terracota:#e0563f;--terracota-prof:#c4452f;--cafe-oscuro:#703e28;--cafe-claro:#8d5537}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--hueso);color:var(--cafe-oscuro);font-family:"Avenir Next","Helvetica Neue",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
a{color:var(--terracota);text-decoration:none;transition:color .18s ease}
a:hover{color:var(--cafe-oscuro)}
.pantalla{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.barra{max-width:1160px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
.barra img{width:140px;height:auto;display:block}
.redes{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
.redes a{color:var(--cafe-oscuro)}
.redes a:hover{color:var(--terracota)}
.centro{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;max-width:1160px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px 72px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start;width:100%;max-width:1112px}
.pildora{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--terracota-prof);color:var(--hueso);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}
h1{margin:0;font-family:"Benton Modern Display",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,164px);line-height:.94;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--cafe-oscuro)}
.entrada{margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;max-width:40ch;color:var(--cafe-claro);text-wrap:pretty}
.acciones{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;width:100%;white-space:nowrap}
.boton{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:17px 34px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--terracota-prof);color:var(--hueso);font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em;line-height:1;transition:background .18s ease,transform .18s ease}
.boton:hover{background:var(--terracota);color:var(--hueso)}
.boton:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.apoyo{font-size:15px;color:var(--cafe-claro)}
.pie{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(112,62,40,.24);width:100%}
.sede{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--cafe-claro)}
.credito{font-size:13px;color:var(--cafe-claro)}
.credito a{color:var(--cafe-claro);text-decoration:underline}
.credito a:hover{color:var(--terracota)}
@media (max-width:680px){
.barra{padding:20px 20px 8px}
.barra img{width:104px}
.redes{gap:14px;font-size:11px}
.centro{padding:16px 20px 28px}
.col{gap:22px}
h1{font-size:clamp(46px,14.5vw,58px);line-height:.9}
.entrada{font-size:17px}
.acciones{white-space:normal;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:12px}
.boton{width:100%;padding:16px 24px;font-size:16px}
.apoyo{text-align:center;font-size:14px}
.pie{flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding-top:20px}
.sede{white-space:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}
.credito{font-size:12px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="pantalla">
<header class="barra">
<img src="/img/logo-cafe-oscuro.png" alt="Ameno Café">
<nav class="redes"><a href={wa}>WhatsApp</a><a href={ig}>Instagram</a></nav>
</header>
<div class="centro">
<div class="col">
<span class="pildora">Nueva etapa · 2026</span>
<h1>Próximamente</h1>
<p class="entrada">Llevamos la experiencia del café de especialidad a tu evento. Estamos preparando algo con calma —y vale la pena esperarlo.</p>
<div class="acciones">
<a class="boton" href={wa}>Cotizar evento</a>
<span class="apoyo">Respondemos por WhatsApp el mismo día.</span>
</div>
<div class="pie">
<span class="sede">Minatitlán y Coatzacoalcos, Veracruz</span>
<span class="credito">©2026 Ameno Café · Diseño por <a href="https://nodoalfa.com">Nodo Alfa</a></span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</body>
</html>
